This directory is a **skeleton** for in-tree forks/embeds of four
GPLv3 projects. Their source is NOT vendored in this PR. Stock apps
are launched by package name. Keep this NOTICE and LICENSE when the
full trees land.

LSPosed  https://github.com/LSPosed/LSPosed   GPL-3.0
  Planned: Zygisk module + manager (do not keep a conflicting
  applicationId). Skeleton: lsposed/

LSPatch  https://github.com/LSPosed/LSPatch   GPL-3.0
  Planned: on-device patcher (lspatch.jar + native).
  Stock manager: org.lsposed.lspatch. Skeleton: lspatch/

Geto     https://github.com/JackEblan/Geto    GPL-3.0-only
  Identified as Don's "Geto" (high confidence): F-Droid
  com.android.geto — apply per-app secure settings.
  Skeleton: geto/

MMRL     https://github.com/MMRLApp/MMRL      GPL-3.0
  Magisk / KernelSU / APatch module manager.
  Stock app: com.dergoogler.mmrl. Skeleton: mmrl/

See README.md for the embed plan and what is stubbed.
